<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia 3-mth Cagamas notes redemption on Oct 4.</title>
<headline>Malaysia 3-mth Cagamas notes redemption on Oct 4.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's national mortgage corporation Cagamas Bhd said a 300-million ringgit three-month notes issue would mature on Friday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the amount will be paid to Bank Negara Malaysia, the authorised depository for the notes, who will in turn pay the noteholders.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
